<title>HONG KONG: Korea LTCB seen planning US$200 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea LTCB seen planning US$200 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Long Term Credit Bank is planning to issue a US$200 million floating rate note, sources close to the transaction said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said the facility will have a final maturity of three to five years.</p>
<p>The issuer is expected to award the mandate in February.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
